      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...Sensei...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 哈……老师……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your hands are...really cold...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 你的手……好冰……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I told you it was freezing outside, didn’t I?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我不是说了外面冷得要命吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah but...you’ve been inside for a while now...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 话是这么说……可你都进来好一会儿了……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why are they...like that?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 怎么……还是这样？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not sure. Maybe because all of the blood in my body has rushed somewhere else?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 不清楚。大概是因为我全身的血都跑到别处去了吧？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...wh...what?...What does that...even mean?...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 哈……什……什么？……那到底……是什么意思啊？……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t worry about it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 别在意。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...um...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 那个……嗯……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you...uhh...havin’ a good time back there?...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 你……呃……在后面还舒服吗？……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you having a good time up there?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 你在上面还舒服吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I feel...really hot...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 我觉得……好热……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then take your shorts off as well.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 那把短裤也脱了吧。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": No...I told ya I'm...not ready for that...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 不要……我都说了……我还没准备好……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Even this is like...a little too...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 光是这样就……有点太……"
    },
