    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I pinch one of Miku’s nipples, which have already gotten hard from a mixture of arousal and my apparently cold hands, and send a jolt through her body.",
      "zh": "我捏住 Miku 的一颗乳头——它在我冰凉的手和情欲的双重刺激下早已硬挺——一阵战栗窜过她的身体。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I can’t see them, but I can feel her legs beginning to shake as she leans up against me to maintain her balance.",
      "zh": "我看不见，但能感觉到她的腿开始发抖，她只能靠在我身上勉强保持平衡。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": H-Hey! Those are...sensitive!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 喂、喂！那里……很敏感的！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve heard that small ones like yours are even more sensitive.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我听说像你这么小的，反而更敏感。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...great! One more way to...kick me while I’m down!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 哦……真棒！又多了一个……往我痛处踩的办法！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I like you like this, Miku. You wouldn’t be the same if you were any larger.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我就喜欢你这样，Miku。要是再大一点，就不是你了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I knew it! You...really do like boys!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 我就知道！你……果然喜欢男生！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": That is absolutely not a thing you should be saying to a man as he’s fondling you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 一个男人正在你身上乱摸的时候，你绝对不该说这种话。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahh...hah! Yeah! I know that! Just...feelin’...a little dizzy...and...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 啊……哈！对！我知道！只是……觉得……有点晕……还有……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can’t...think straight...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 脑子……转不动了……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t think at all, then. Just let me do my thing.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 那就别想了。随我来就好。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your thing is...friggin’ weird, Sensei...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 老师，你那套……真他妈奇怪……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": How’s this...doin’ anything at all for you?...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ": 这样……你到底爽不爽啊？……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Honestly? It’s not. ",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 说实话？没什么感觉。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": But it’s fun seeing you act like this and is one more step on the way to getting you to suck my-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 不过看你这副样子挺有意思，而且是通往让你含住我的——路上的又一步。"
    },
